10
00:00:27,995 --> 00:00:29,528
Both halves matter equally.

11
00:00:30,078 --> 00:00:34,284
Five lectures, and notice the shape: one on what these tools can and can't do

12
00:00:34,284 --> 00:00:38,872
honestly, one on the actual batch, and three on the specific ways a batch goes wrong

13
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:39,964
